      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lyons%2C_Nebraska",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lyons’ historic roller mill, built in 1869 and powered by a dam on Logan Creek, operated until 1931.",
